      "translation": "从给定的<a href=\"ReactiveMongoDatabaseFactory.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mongodb\"><code>factory</code></a>中获取指定名称的<code>database</code>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Obtain the default <code>database</code> form the given <a href=\"ReactiveMongoDatabaseFactory.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mongodb\"><code>factory</code></a>.",
      "translation": "从给定的<a href=\"ReactiveMongoDatabaseFactory.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mongodb\"><code>factory</code></a>获取默认的<code>database</code>。",
      "count": 1
